  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a breakdancer gains experience, he picks up a number of dance moves that allow him to express the rhythm he feels within his bones. A breakdancer begins play with one dance move. He gains an additional dance move for every two levels of breakdancer he attains. A breakdancer cannot select an individual dance move more than once.</p>\n<p>Dance moves with a listed \"minimum rhythm\" require that the breakdancer have at least that much rhythm in order to perform the dance move.</p>\n<p>Dance moves with a listed \"rhythm cost\" require that the breakdancer expend that much rhythm in order to perform the dance move.</p>\n<p>The Difficulty Class (DC) for a saving throw against a breakdancer's dance move is 10 + 1/2 the breakdancer's class level + the breakdancer's Dexterity modifier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/breakdancer#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
